  "description": "Nobody said being a parent was easy. It’s especially hard for Belphegor Verscios, the adoptive father of an exceptionally gifted human girl who insists on becoming a warrior someday and defeating the Demon King — who, unbeknownst to her, happens to be him. But when you’re a doting father like Belphegor, what else can you do but try to support her dreams while simultaneously making sure she never reaches her goal? It’s a fine line to walk, but he must succeed at any cost, or suffer the worst fate he could ever imagine… disappointing his daughter. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
